<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>أكاديمية تحقيق الطموح</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;900&family=Tajawal:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --pink: #FF4FA0;
    --pink-light: #FFB3D9;
    --purple: #7C3AED;
    --purple-light: #A855F7;
    --orange: #F97316;
    --blue: #38BDF8;
    --yellow: #FCD34D;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --bg: #FFF0F7;
    --text-dark: #1a0a2e;
    --text-mid: #5b2d7e;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(124,58,237,0.13);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Cairo', 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    overflow-x: hidden;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  /* ===== HEADER / HERO ===== */
  header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF4FA0 0%, #7C3AED 50%, #38BDF8 100%);
    padding: 0 0 60px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  header::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.05'%3E%3Ccircle cx='30' cy='30' r='10'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E") repeat;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 18px 40px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .nav-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .nav-logo img {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    list-style: none;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 7px 16px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  }

  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 20px 30px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    color: white;
    padding: 6px 20px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    animation: fadeDown 0.7s ease both;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: white;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    animation: fadeDown 0.8s 0.1s ease both;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .hero h1 span {
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  .hero p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
    animation: fadeDown 0.8s 0.2s ease both;
  }

  .hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    animation: fadeDown 0.8s 0.3s ease both;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: white;
    color: var(--purple);
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
  }

  /* ===== STATS STRIP ===== */
  .stats-strip {
    background: white;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(124,58,237,0.1);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: -30px 40px 0;
    border-radius: 20px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 20;
    overflow: hidden;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.4s ease both;
  }

  .stat-item {
    padding: 24px 36px;
    text-align: center;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 140px;
    border-left: 1px solid #f0e6ff;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .stat-item:last-child { border-left: none; }

  .stat-item:hover { background: #fdf0ff; }

  .stat-num {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink), var(--purple));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ===== SECTIONS ===== */
  section {
    padding: 80px 40px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .section-title h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .section-title h2::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    right: 50%;
    transform: translateX(50%);
    width: 60px;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--pink), var(--purple));
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .section-title p {
    color: var(--text-mid);
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  /* ===== ABOUT ===== */
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 50px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-text h3 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--purple);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .about-text p {
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .about-features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .feature-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdf0ff, #f0f4ff);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    border-right: 4px solid var(--pink);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .about-visual {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink) 0%, var(--purple) 100%);
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: 40px;
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-visual::before {
    content: '🎓';
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 8rem;
    opacity: 0.1;
    top: -20px;
    left: -20px;
  }

  .about-visual h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-visual p {
    opacity: 0.9;
    line-height: 1.7;
    position: relative;
  }

  .tagline-badges {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .tagline-badge {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ===== COURSES ===== */
  #courses { background: #fdf6ff; border-radius: 40px; padding: 80px 40px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .courses-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .course-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 30px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    border-top: 5px solid var(--pink);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .course-card:nth-child(2) { border-top-color: var(--purple); }
  .course-card:nth-child(3) { border-top-color: var(--orange); }
  .course-card:nth-child(4) { border-top-color: var(--blue); }
  .course-card:nth-child(5) { border-top-color: #10B981; }

  .course-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(124,58,237,0.18);
  }

  .course-icon {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFE0F0, #F0E6FF);
  }

  .course-card:nth-child(2) .course-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EDE9FE, #DDD6FE); }
  .course-card:nth-child(3) .course-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF0E0, #FFE4B5); }
  .course-card:nth-child(4) .course-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E0F7FF, #B3EEFF); }
  .course-card:nth-child(5) .course-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D1FAE5, #A7F3D0); }

  .course-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .course-teacher {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .course-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .detail-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #555;
  }

  .detail-row span:first-child {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .course-price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF0F7, #F5F0FF);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .price-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .price-value {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--purple);
  }

  .course-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    left: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink), var(--purple));
    color: white;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ===== SUMMER CAMP ===== */
  .summer-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF4FA0 0%, #7C3AED 100%);
    border-radius: 40px;
    padding: 60px 40px;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
  }

  .summer-section::before {
    content: '☀️';
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 12rem;
    opacity: 0.08;
    top: -30px;
    right: -30px;
  }

  .summer-section h2 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .summer-section p {
    opacity: 0.9;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .summer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .summer-item {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 20px 14px;
    text-align: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .summer-item:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }

  .summer-item .item-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .summer-item h4 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; }

  /* ===== REGISTRATION FORM ===== */
  .form-section {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: 60px 50px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 50px rgba(124,58,237,0.12);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .form-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .form-group.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }

  label {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-mid);
  }

  input, select, textarea {
    padding: 13px 16px;
    border: 2px solid #e8d5f5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    background: #fdf8ff;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    outline: none;
    direction: rtl;
  }

  input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--purple);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124,58,237,0.1);
    background: white;
  }

  textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 100px; }

  .form-submit {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink), var(--purple));
    color: white;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    margin-top: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(124,58,237,0.3);
  }

  .form-submit:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(124,58,237,0.4);
  }

  .form-note {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #888;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  /* Success Message */
  .success-msg {
    display: none;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D1FAE5, #A7F3D0);
    border-radius: 16px;
    color: #065F46;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  /* ===== CONTACT ===== */
  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .contact-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 28px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .contact-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); }

  .contact-icon {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin: 0 auto 14px;
  }

  .contact-card h4 { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .contact-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; }

  /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
  footer {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a0a2e 0%, #2d1050 100%);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 50px 40px 30px;
    margin-top: 60px;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .footer-tagline {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--pink), var(--yellow), var(--blue));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--pink); }

  .footer-copy {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding-top: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  /* ===== ANIMATIONS ===== */
  @keyframes fadeDown {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  /* ===== SCROLL ANIMATION ===== */
  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
  }

  .reveal.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  /* ===== MOBILE ===== */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    nav { padding: 14px 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    section { padding: 50px 20px; }
    .stats-strip { margin: -20px 16px 0; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .form-section { padding: 40px 24px; }
    #courses { padding: 50px 20px; }
    .summer-section { padding: 40px 20px; }
  }

  /* Admin Edit Notice */
  .admin-banner {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7C3AED, #FF4FA0);
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 10px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .whatsapp-float {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 30px;
    background: #25D366;
    color: white;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(37,211,102,0.4);
    z-index: 1000;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }

  .whatsapp-float:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(37,211,102,0.4); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 6px 40px rgba(37,211,102,0.7); }
  }

  .section-bg-alt { background: #f8f0ff; border-radius: 40px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- WhatsApp Float -->
<a href="https://wa.me/213665603281" class="whatsapp-float" target="_blank" title="تواصل عبر واتساب">💬</a>

<!-- HEADER -->
<header>
  <nav>
    <a href="#" class="nav-logo">
      <img id="navLogo" src="logo.png" onerror="this.style.display='none'" style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5)">
      <span>🎓</span>
      أكاديمية تحقيق الطموح
    </a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#about">من نحن</a></li>
      <li><a href="#courses">الدورات</a></li>
      <li><a href="#summer">المخيم الصيفي</a></li>
      <li><a href="#register">التسجيل</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">اتصل بنا</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge">🌟 الدورات الصيفية 2026 متاحة الآن!</div>
    <h1>أكاديمية <span>تحقيق الطموح</span></h1>
    <p>نصنع الفرق ونبني المستقبل — تعلم، تطوير، تميز، نجاح. ساعدنا مئات التلاميذ على التفوق والنجاح.</p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="#register" class="btn-primary">📝 سجّل الآن</a>
      <a href="#courses" class="btn-secondary">🔍 اكتشف الدورات</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Stats Strip -->
  <div class="stats-strip">
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num">+500</div>
      <div class="stat-label">تلميذ مستفيد</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num">2026</div>
      <div class="stat-label">موسم صيفي مميز</div>
